[[0,1101480,0,15,0,15,"2016-06-12T10:52:42","HamHater3","",[],"<p>Here's an article explaining why the fats should be shamed (which isn't such a bad idea). Obeasts use more gasoline/oil than normal people.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.phillymag.com/news/2012/10/12/solve-americas-obesity-problem-shame/\">http://www.phillymag.com/news/2012/10/12/solve-americas-obesity-problem-shame/</a></p>","Another reason to hate fatties... (good article).","","fatpeoplehate"],[1,5480800,0,2,0,2,"2016-06-12T11:18:06","journalistsarelazy","",[],"<p>The comments section was hilarious! </p>"],[1,5480831,0,2,0,2,"2016-06-12T11:24:19","KikiCat","",[],"<p>Finally a voice of reason in the media!</p>"],[2,5481019,5480831,0,0,0,"2016-06-12T12:14:06","Candid","",[],"<p>This is from October 2012.</p>"],[3,5481495,5481019,0,0,0,"2016-06-12T13:51:21","HamHater3","",[],"<p>Lol, I know it's an older article...but it makes complete sense.</p>"],[3,5485312,5481019,0,0,0,"2016-06-12T20:23:13","KikiCat","",[],"<p>God, the writer pretty much predicted things to come. </p>"],[4,5485469,5485312,0,0,0,"2016-06-12T20:36:59","Candid","",[],"<p>Unless something changes, things are going to keep getting worse.</p>"],[1,5481089,0,4,0,4,"2016-06-12T12:31:41","Carsandsarcasm","",[],"<p>This is exactly right. It's frustrating to me that we have a solution that works and we don't apply it. We are trying everything in our power to gently and kindly ask people to lose weight and obesity just keeps climbing. If you want to solve a problem, enforce shame and it will happen. The point I always make for this is that this idea is not targetting at the current generation. Most of them will be fat forever and will overeat from being shamed. The idea is to create a culture where getting fat in the first place is bad. It will prevent kids from letting their weight get out of control.</p>"],[1,5484549,0,1,0,1,"2016-06-12T19:12:43","Daucus7","",[],"<p>Not only do obeasts use more fuel for their vehicles, it takes longer for their vehicles to come to a complete stop. That alone should make car insurance higher if you're fat. </p>"]]
